SLO per step: p99 <= 300 ms, 5xx <= 0.1 %, served >= 95 % of offered. The plan's target is 300 payments/s sustained within the SLOs.

**Highest rate sustained within the SLOs: 20 payments/s offered by k6 (plus background).**

k6 over the whole run: 30312 requests, 4247 dropped (concurrency limit reached), server errors 6.865 %, p99 9989 ms.

